<title>CROATIA: TENNIS-ATP RESULTS FROM UMAG, CROATIA.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ATP RESULTS FROM UMAG, CROATIA.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the second round of</p>
<p>the ATP men's tournament in Umag, Croatia, on Wednesday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Sergi Bruguera (Spain) beat Andrej Merinov (Russia) 6-0 6-1</p>
<p>8-Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) beat Marzo Martelli (Italy) 6-1</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>5-Dominik Hrbaty (Slovakia) beat Jacobo Diaz (Spain) 6-0 6-2</p>
</text>
